## Development

### Prerequisites

```bash
uv tool install poethepoet
```

### Setup

```bash
git clone https://github.com/{{ github_org }}/{{ project_slug }}.git
cd {{ project_slug }}
uv sync --all-groups
pre-commit install
```

### Commands

| Purpose              | Command                                       |
| -------------------- | --------------------------------------------- |
| Install deps         | `uv run poe sync`                             |
| All tests + coverage | `uv run poe test`                             |
| Single test          | `uv run pytest tests/path.py::test_name -q`   |
| Lint + format        | `uv run poe prek`                             |
| Type-check (mypy)    | `uv run mypy src tests`                       |
| Type-check (pyright) | `uv run pyright`                              |
| Build docs           | `uv run poe docs`                             |
| Serve docs           | `uv run poe docs-serve`                       |
| Full pre-flight      | `uv run poe check`                            |

